{
 "_doc": "READINGS for the e1871_postfire terrain spec (T-1251): the ground's elevation at named points of the 1904 Prairie Avenue reach, read from the USGS 3D Elevation Program's 1 m bare-earth model through its point query service on 2026-09-28, plus the one City of Chicago benchmark inside the reach's neighbourhood. tools/check_terrain_e1871.py converts every used reading to the internal datum and holds the spec's grade controls to them; nothing here is typed into the spec by hand.",
 "ticket": "T-1251",
 "fetched": "2026-09-28",
